        <ids:property instructions="CorrosionTreatment || from IFC documentation: Determines corrosion treatment for metal components. This property is provided if the requirement needs to be expressed (a) independently of a material specification and (b) as a mere requirements statement rather than a workshop design/ processing feature." dataType="IFCLABEL">
